{"articleNo":"131564","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=131564&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제] 2015-2 제19기 kit 국제교류도우미 선발 안내(제출관련 수정)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.07.08","hit":"3791","attachments":[{"name":"2015-2 국제교류도우미 선발 계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=131564&attachNo=74856"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2015-2&nbsp; 제19기 kit 국제교류도우미 모집 공고</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ kit 국제교류도우미란?</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ금오공과대학교에서의 생활을 시작하는 외국인 학생(한국어연수, 학부과정, 교환학생)들의 생활 정착에서부터 학사 및 교내외 활동에 이르는 전반적인 부분에 대한 도움을 제공, 재학생과 외국인 학생간의 상호교류를 활성화시킴으로써 글로벌 리더로서의 소양을 기르고자 구성된 프로그램</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 지원 자격</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 1학기 이상 수학한 학부생(재학생 및 휴학생)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 책임감이 강하고 적극적이며 사교적인 학생 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 봉사정신이 강한 학생</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 외국어 가능자</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 국제교류도우미 오리엔테이션(2015년 7월 22일&nbsp;수 16:30)에 반드시</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;참가하여야 하며, 선발 이후 8월 초부터 활동할 수 있는 학생</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 활동사항 및 기간</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 활동기간: 2015년 8월 1일 ~2015년 12월 4일(2015학년도 2학기)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 활동사항: </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 1) 외국인 학생과의 1:1 혹은 1:2 팀별 매칭&nbsp;교류</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2)&nbsp;유학생 입국 픽업(공항 및 버스터미널) 후 생활관 입소 돕기</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) KIT인터내셔널 캠프 등 캠프 참가</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 세계 문화의 이해 활동 참가</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 5) 학교 및 구미지역 안내 캠퍼스 투어 및 수강신청을 비롯한 전반적인 학교</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 생활에 대한 안내 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 6) 국제교류교육원 공식 행사(오리엔테이션, 단체활동)등 참가</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 제출서류 및 신청방법</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 제출서류: 국제교류도우미 참가 신청서 혹은 팀장 추천서&nbsp;1부</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 공인어학성적증명서 사본 1부</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (어학성적 소지자에 한하며, 모의토익 성적 제출 가능)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 성적증명서 1부 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#7c84ef\">개인정보제공 동의서 1부(미제출 시 접수 불가)</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"></strong></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 신청방법: </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">국제교류교육원 테크노관 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">458</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">호로 제출</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;제출 서류는 반드시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">워드 작성</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">요망</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u><font color=\"#0900ff\">직접 제출이 불가할 경우 서류 출력 후 스캔본 메일로 제출</font></u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ｏ 문의사항 : 국제교류교육원 </span>신지민</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMIL